Revision history for Net-Correios

0.005   2026-11-26
    - renew access tokens automatically before they expire, and retry the
      request once when the API rejects an expired token;
    - new constructor options: token_ttl and token_renew_before;

0.004   2026-06-05
    - fix Manifestacao issue;

0.003   2026-02-27
    - add DCe endpoints;

0.002	2024-07-05
    - add manifestacao endpoints;
    - improve "empresas" api support;
    - add support for "carta" in "preco" API;
    - support creation of PPN (new PLP) tags;

0.001   2023-09-22
    - initial release.
